{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S05等短时段里感受词偏密，部分意象连续切换，容易让人来不及消化；X的叙事连贯性和结尾回扣更自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点高亮让人不用逐字阅读就能抓住每段的情绪和叙事转折，感受字缩小、部分内容按音乐时机出现，也更适合边听边扫。它对声音、身体、情绪变化的描写明显更细，能让人感受到情绪不是简单地从高兴变悲伤，而是在甜蜜中逐渐生出不安和舍不得。X的完整叙事句更顺畅，结尾回扣开头也更漂亮，但综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad4e0f1a-5635-4f94-b53f-3e119f2979b8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T043350921160Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.61, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:35:10.545916+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1e40162efb2f07b73f05dfe9e65100fdb618dddc5eb0dd1f1a0813849ea6da37", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2